    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Not everybody can be a real Dave. Can you?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a chaotic dave-multiverse where every player is... <strong>Dave... </strong>at least one version of Dave.  <br>In this 2D sidescrolling plattformer you and up to 11 friends get thrown into dimension after dimension, each with wild mechanics, unpredictable twists, and one single goal: <br><strong>Collect the most shiny things and prove you're the <i>real</i> Dave. </strong><br> <br> <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771790/extras/b8edddf43461598c5249bbaac1fb4f60.avif?t=1748625822\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12-player madness</strong> \u2013 Play with friends locally, online via browser, mobile, or PC. All Dave. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9+ unique dimensions</strong> \u2013 Each with its own set of rules, visuals, and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two rounds are the same</strong> \u2013 Dimensions are randomized, and chaos is guaranteed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-platform play</strong> \u2013 Whether on phone, laptop, or gaming rig, join the chaos seamlessly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller support</strong> \u2013 Gamepads or mobiles recommended for optimal Dave-control.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>How to Win? Be the Best Dave!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect, dodge, sabotage \u2013 and most of all, survive. In some dimensions gravity changes. In others, your own dimension might turn against you. Stay alert, stay shiny, stay Dave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771790/extras/02e3bae4cac43d8a3e28f2ca0f062443.avif?t=1748625822\" width=576 height=586 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Not everybody can be a real Dave. Can you?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a chaotic dave-multiverse where every player is... <strong>Dave... </strong>at least one version of Dave.  <br>In this 2D sidescrolling plattformer you and up to 11 friends get thrown into dimension after dimension, each with wild mechanics, unpredictable twists, and one single goal: <br><strong>Collect the most shiny things and prove you're the <i>real</i> Dave. </strong><br> <br> <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771790/extras/b8edddf43461598c5249bbaac1fb4f60.avif?t=1748625822\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12-player madness</strong> \u2013 Play with friends locally, online via browser, mobile, or PC. All Dave. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9+ unique dimensions</strong> \u2013 Each with its own set of rules, visuals, and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two rounds are the same</strong> \u2013 Dimensions are randomized, and chaos is guaranteed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-platform play</strong> \u2013 Whether on phone, laptop, or gaming rig, join the chaos seamlessly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller support</strong> \u2013 Gamepads or mobiles recommended for optimal Dave-control.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>How to Win? Be the Best Dave!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect, dodge, sabotage \u2013 and most of all, survive. In some dimensions gravity changes. In others, your own dimension might turn against you. Stay alert, stay shiny, stay Dave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771790/extras/02e3bae4cac43d8a3e28f2ca0f062443.avif?t=1748625822\" width=576 height=586 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Join the search for the ultimative, the original, the one and only: DAVE! Compete against other daves, to find out who really deserves to be called Dave. Run as fast as you can, adapt to quick dimensional hops, master their unique mechanics and collect the shiny things.",
